WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:00.820
Hey guys!

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:02.716
Today is an awesome day,

00:00:02.716 --> 00:00:05.795
well actually, in truth, every day
is an awesome day right?

00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:07.621
Because every day
is a gift from God.

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:09.349
And we can&nbsp;boldly say that;

00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:11.842
"This is the day
that the Lord has made,

00:00:11.842 --> 00:00:15.122
I will rejoice and
I will be glad in it."

00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:19.180
You see, you need to choose
to live in that truth.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.120
and you know, we as Christians,
we know&nbsp;that

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:28.066
life only starts to make sense
when we find God.

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:31.023
And then to abide in Him,
He in us and&nbsp;we in Him.

00:00:31.023 --> 00:00:33.010
And if you want to share
that with the world,

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.442
being bold, not ashamed,
then do that.

00:00:37.442 --> 00:00:40.945
Do it with the Merch!
This is a great way of sharing the gospel,

00:00:40.945 --> 00:00:42.149
it arrived today,

00:00:42.288 --> 00:00:42.849
Found&nbsp;God?

00:00:42.849 --> 00:00:45.409
And I'm going to wear it boldly,
 I'm not going to be ashamed,

00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:50.320
because we know that the&nbsp;gospel
has the power to save Souls.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.288
So go, and be bold
and proclaim the kingdom of God.

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:58.650
Do it in love, in truth,
and through the Spirit!

